# pyrightconfig.json is tracked on purpose: without an explicit pythonVersion
# Pylance falls back to an older interpreter and reports bogus errors against
# this codebase. Only the per-machine override stays ignored. This replaces an
# earlier "*pyrightconfig*" pattern, which silently excluded the tracked file.
pyrightconfig.local.json
